# Settings > Updates (report 047 P1, D4) on a development build (0.0.0-dev, channel development): the check and the
# notes of the latest release, never an offer: "Dev build" (grey) on the rows, the Launcher level with the
# information row saying why there is no install, What's new with the latest release's notes. Touch: a tap highlights
# a row, a tap on the highlighted row runs it (Check now, What's new); the header's Esc goes back. Review only: no
# golden.
title updates development build
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-05
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.0.0-dev development arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
shot updates_dev_root
expect_text "Dev build"
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_dev
expect_text "Dev build"
expect_color "Dev build" 9A9A9A
# touch: Check now highlighted, then run (its dot blue while the held answer is pending)
update answer pending
tapbutton "Check now"
wait 300
shot updates_dev_touch_selected
tapbutton "Check now"
wait 300
shot updates_dev_touch_checking
expect_text "Checking for updates..."
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
wait 1000
key UP
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_dev_launcher
header updates_dev_launcher "Settings > Updates > Launcher" "Updates > Launcher" Launcher
expect_text "install by hand"
expect_text "0.0.0-dev, development, arm64"
tapbutton "What's new in 0.8.13"
wait 300
shot updates_dev_whatsnew
tapbutton Esc
wait 300
tapbutton Esc
wait 300
shot updates_dev_back
expect_text "Check now"
